## Sales & Orders

**What is the total revenue generated by valid orders?**

R$ 15,735,527.03 across 98,207 valid orders — composed of R$ 13,494,400.74 in items + R$ 2,241,126.29 in freight.

**What is the average order value?**

R$ 160.23 per valid order.

**How does order volume evolve over time?**

Steady growth through 2017, peaking in November 2017 (Black Friday: 7,544 orders, R$ 1,172,191.68), then stabilizing at ~6,200–7,300 orders/month in 2018. The 2016-09/12 and 2018-09/10 months are partial.

