* **Cities**: São Paulo leads by far (14,977 customers, 15.6% of the base), ahead of Rio de Janeiro (6,615), Belo Horizonte (2,667), Brasília (2,064) and Curitiba (1,463).

**How many customers are associated with inconsistent location records?**

122 customers (0.13%) have divergent city/state across their orders (flagged by `location_inconsistent` in `dim_customers`).

