## Logistics & Delivery

**What is the average time between purchase and delivery?**

12.56 days from purchase to customer delivery, split into 3.23 days (purchase → carrier) + 9.33 days (carrier → customer).

**What percentage of orders are delivered later than expected?**

8.11% of delivered orders (7,826 of 96,478) arrive after the estimated delivery date. On average, deliveries arrive 11.18 days earlier than estimated — estimates are conservative.

